  "description": {
    "en-US": "Memoirs of Missionary Priests and other Catholics of both sexes that have suffered death in England on religious accounts from the year 1577 to 1684 (1741-42): Challoner's lives of the English martyrs, from Cuthbert Mayne and Edmund Campion through Robert Southwell, Henry Garnet, Edmund Arrowsmith and Oliver Plunket, arranged by year, with the 1924 editor's introduction, notes and appendices.",
    "pt-BR": "Memórias dos Padres Missionários e de outros católicos de ambos os sexos que sofreram a morte na Inglaterra por motivo de religião, de 1577 a 1684 (1741-42): as vidas dos mártires ingleses por Challoner, de Cuthbert Mayne e Edmund Campion a Robert Southwell, Henry Garnet, Edmund Arrowsmith e Oliver Plunket, por ordem de anos, com a introdução, as notas e os apêndices do editor de 1924."
  },
  "composed": 1741,
